cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "flow_inference: guided flow-based sampling of stochastic processes"
abstract: >-
  Draws samples of a stochastic process (a Gaussian process, an SDE solution, or a
  process learned by a neural flow) that satisfy user-specified conditions, by
  integrating a guided probability-flow ODE or SDE from noise to the process.
authors:
